OL,3,GNEWSABook highlights neurodivergent    
OL,4,A'unsung heroes'                        
OL,6,FA book featuring the stories of        
OL,7,Fneurodivergent people celebrates their 
OL,8,Fartistic talent and puts them in the   
OL,9,Fspotlight, a woman behind the          
OL,10,Fpublication has said.                  
OL,12,FFormer art teacher Louise Chandler set 
OL,13,Fup Shine Arts and Well-Being CIC in    
OL,14,FBurton Latimer, Northamptonshire, in   
OL,15,F2022 to provide art activities for     
OL,16,Fyoung people with additional needs.    
